@* Роль: карточки метрик (площадки, доли игр/времени, демография и т.д.). Figma: In-App_приоритет → cells (37879:1475).
Родитель: Views/InApp/Index.cshtml. *@
<section class="in-app-metrics-cards" aria-label="Метрики In-App">
  <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__inner">
    <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__grid">
      <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__cell in-app-metrics-cards__cell--platforms">
        <img
          class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-bg"
          src="~/css/blocks/in-app-metrics-cards/in-app-metrics-platforms-bg-6b6d98.png"
          width="670"
          height="484"
          alt=""
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-content">
          <img
            class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-icon"
            src="~/css/blocks/in-app-metrics-cards/in-app-metrics-platforms-icon.svg"
            width="100"
            height="100"
            alt=""
            decoding="async"
          />
          <h2 class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-title">Более 130 000 площадок</h2>
          <p class="in-app-metrics-cards__platforms-desc">
            Поддерживаем статичные<br />
            и интерактивные баннерные,<br />
            нативные и видео-форматы
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__cell in-app-metrics-cards__cell--games-share">
        <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__games-share-value">50%</span>
        <p class="in-app-metrics-cards__games-share-text">
          ин-апп инвентаря приходится<br />
          на игры от ведущих студий
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__cell in-app-metrics-cards__cell--mobile-time">
        <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__mobile-time-value">90%</span>
        <p class="in-app-metrics-cards__mobile-time-lead">
          мобильного времени пользователей<br />
          проводят в приложениях
        </p>
        <p class="in-app-metrics-cards__mobile-time-note">
          Интеграция со всеми системами<br />
          мобильной аналитики для трекинга конверсий
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__cell in-app-metrics-cards__cell--demographics">
        <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-inner">
          <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-body">
            <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-stat">
              <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-value">43%</span>
              <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-label">мужчины</span>
            </div>
            <div class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-stat">
              <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-value">57%</span>
              <span class="in-app-metrics-cards__demographics-label">женщины</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
